You must strictly adhere to the project architecture. Before modifying any files, check this map and read the referenced rule files if applicable:

- IF modifying files in `chat-app-backend/**/*` -> Read following rule files:
  - `.cursor/rules/avoid-race-conditions.instructions.mdc`
  - `.cursor/rules/java-class-member-order.instructions.mdc`
  - `.cursor/rules/maven-test-split.instructions.mdc`
- IF modifying files in `chat-app-frontend/**/*` -> Read following rule files:
  - `.cursor/rules/react-component-wrapper.instructions.mdc`
  - `.cursor/rules/react-colocate-state.instructions.mdc`
  - `.cursor/rules/react-interactive-titles.instructions.mdc`

CRITICAL: If a matching rule file exists for your target directory, you MUST explicitly look up its contents before writing any code.
